snp4.13:3.1 starts: One who knows
snp4.13:3.2 starts: any conventions
snp4.13:3.3 starts: One who’s uninvolved:
snp4.13:3.4 starts: When he’s forming no predilection
snp4.13:13.1 starts: The brahman has nothing
snp4.13:13.2 starts: when considering what’s grasped
snp4.13:13.3 starts: Thus he has gone
